If you wish, you can raid the camp to collect loot (chocolate x526). Since &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Red Falcon Bobo&lt;/color&gt; is just a small, independent group, you can attack them without any broader diplomatic consequences.

The camp will pack up and move on in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;30 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_WorkSite</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>76</id>
					<name>Mindless Fennec Foxes</name>
					<appearanceTick>11383000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>0</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>11479105</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Theodos Glabas&lt;/color&gt;, an acolyte of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt;, recently lost a scouting party to a pack of (*Threat)79 manhunting fennec foxes(/Threat). He wants to draw the beasts towards you to be killed, to uphold his honor.The fennec foxes will arrive at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2 hours&lt;/color&gt; after you accept.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_Manhunters_ItemPod</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
