					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>A 26-year-old hearth tender named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lev Hatten&lt;/color&gt; is calling for help! He is hiding from a vengeful machine persona who he recently offended. He wants to flee and join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

