						<description>The archotechs announce their presence from the sky, and in the mind, and obviously wish to be known by all. The archotechs rightfully look down on us, as we look down on our inferiors. In the future, the archotechs will depart. They will bring a select few humans with them, and leave the rest behind to suffer.</description>
