						<memberName>Doper</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The spirits of thought and consciousness live within animals and humans alike. The spirits can reveal their nature to us when we expand our consciousness using the tools we have been given to do so. Our book says that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Deadfinger&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The spirits of thought and consciousness live within animals and humans alike. The spirits can reveal their nature to us when we expand our consciousness using the tools we have been given to do so. Our book says that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>DoubleLoop</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Green</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.891, 0.686, 0.227, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Animist</li>
							<li>AnimalPersonhood</li>
