						<memberName>Libertor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Archic Archotechnist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Archic Archotechnist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Archotechs stand as sovereign consciousnesses, and recognize and judge each of us individually the same way. The archotechs fight endlessly among themselves, in ways most cannot see, and the strong take pieces of consciousness from the weak. In the future, the archotechs will depart. They will bring with them the ones they have noticed, and leave the rest behind to dissolve in the universe's eternal entropy.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Archotechs stand as sovereign consciousnesses, and recognize and judge each of us individually the same way. The archotechs fight endlessly among themselves, in ways most cannot see, and the strong take pieces of consciousness from the weak. In the future, the archotechs will depart. They will bring with them the ones they have noticed, and leave the rest behind to dissolve in the universe's eternal entropy.</descriptionTemplate>
